message: >-
  If you use Lunar Orbiter Atlas in research, teaching, or other work, please
  cite this software using the metadata below.
title: Lunar Orbiter Atlas
abstract: >-
  A local application that displays photographs from the NASA Lunar Orbiter
  missions on an interactive 3D Moon, using images and metadata from the Lunar
  and Planetary Institute archive.
